4.1 The following items are excluded from the Solar O&M Services and shall be undertaken by the Client at its own cost:

(a) Replacement of solar modules damaged by vandalism, theft, or natural disaster (including lightning, flood, or windstorm) beyond the Contractor's reasonable control;
